OL,4,G1300FClassical Live
OL,5,     GMark Forrest introduces an
OL,6,     Gafternoon of of specially made
OL,7,     Grecordings from the Belfast
OL,8,     GInternational Arts Festival plus
OL,9,     Gthe theme of dance continues.
OL,10,G1500FChoral Evensong
OL,11,     GLive from Bath Abbey, with music
OL,12,     Gby Bairstow, Charpentier,
OL,13,     GSandstrom and Bach.
OL,14,G1600FComposer of the Week: Prokofiev
OL,15,     GKate Molleson explores
OL,16,     GProkofiev's escape from
OL,17,     Grevolution and his search for
OL,18,     Gfresh inspiration in America.
