OL,4,G1700FIn Tune
OL,5,     GThe Choir of Clare College,
OL,6,     GCambrige, is live in studio for a
OL,7,     Gperformance. Petroc also welcomes
OL,8,     GBishop Guli Francis-Dehqani to
OL,9,     Gdiscuss her book, Listening to
OL,10,     Gthe Music of the Soul.
OL,11,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,12,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,13,     Gsoundscape of classical music.
OL,14,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,15,     GThe BBC National Orchestra of
OL,16,     GWales and conductor Jaime Martin
OL,17,     Gperform Greig, selections from
OL,18,     GTchaikovsky's Swan Lake, and
OL,19,     GNielsen's Flute Concerto with
OL,20,     Gsoloist Elizaveta Ivanova.
