OL,4,G2145FThe Essay: Accompanying Austen
OL,5,     GAntonia Quirke speaks to
OL,6,     Gcomposers who've scored original
OL,7,     Gmusic for Austen adaptations
OL,8,     Gabout their musical choices and
OL,9,     Galso about the music Austen
OL,10,     Gencountered. Today: Jeremy Sams.
OL,11,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,12,     GHannah Peel presents an
OL,13,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,14,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,15,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,16,     Geverything in between.
